{
  "card": {
    "claim": "For Atlantic Union Bankshares' Q1 2025 Form 10-Q, the \"provision for loan losses\" is the ALLL-activity-table line \"Provision charged to operations\" of $17,430 thousand (three months ended March 31, 2025), which moves only the on-balance-sheet allowance for loan and lease losses. The income-statement \"Provision for credit losses\" of $17,638 thousand is a broader measure that also includes the provision for unfunded commitments (about $0.2 million; 17,638 − 17,430 = 208, equal to the change in the reserve for unfunded commitments 15,041 → 15,249), and should not be labelled the loan-loss provision.",
    "scope": "Issuer-only (Atlantic Union Bankshares Corp), this filing only (accession 0000883948-25-000046, sha256 bcd672a2…b51e), three months ended 2025-03-31, USD thousands; term mapping for \"loan-loss provision\" vs \"provision for credit losses\". Not a pack-wide label change.",
    "alternative": "Treat the income-statement \"Provision for credit losses\" of $17,638 thousand as the loan-loss provision (i.e., do not separate the unfunded-commitment component), and compare that total against the loan allowance.",
    "id": "review-02",
    "item": "interpretation-02",
    "witnesses": [
      "A1 Note 4 ALLL activity table, 2025 Total column (tool line 843): \"Provision charged to operations 15,638 1,792 17,430\"; caption (tool line 835): \"The following tables show the ALLL activity by loan segment for the three months ended March 31, (dollars in thousands)\"",
      "A1 Consolidated Statements of Income, three months ended March 31, 2025 column (tool line 227): \"Provision for credit losses 17,638\"",
      "A1 MD&A 'Provision for Credit Losses' paragraph (tool line 2487): \"The provision for credit losses for the first quarter of 2025 reflected a provision of $17.4 million for loan losses and a $0.2 million provision for unfunded commitments.\"",
      "A1 MD&A ACL summary table (tool line 2499): \"Total Reserve for Unfunded Commitments 15,249 15,041\""
    ]
  },
